{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05367","headline":"绿墀怨 · 李元紘","name":"绿墀怨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"征马噪金珂，嫖姚向北河。\n绿苔行迹少，红粉泪痕多。\n宝屋粘花絮，银筝覆网罗。\n别君如昨日，青海雁频过。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李元紘","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05367.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05367","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}